{
  "key": 29707,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_OverHere",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "Over here! This way!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Salut, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "Hé, par ici!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_IllBeOuttahere",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: OK, gramps!\n",
        "I brought {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} like I said!\r",
        "All right, I’ll be outta here!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Voilà, pépé!\n",
        "J’amène {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, comme convenu!\r",
        "Allez, je mets les voiles!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_Ellipses",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: ...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: ...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_OKIGetIt",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...OK...\n",
        "I get it...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ... OK...\n",
        "Je vois...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_EveryonesHereFinally",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Hm! Everyone’s here finally.\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, everyone, listen.\r",
        "You may have forgotten already, but\n",
        "I study the evolution of Pokémon.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: Hum! Tout le monde est là.\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, tout le monde, écoutez.\r",
        "Vous l’avez peut-être oublié, mais\n",
        "j’étudie l’évolution des Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_MoreIStudyMoreMysteries",
      "en_US": [
        "But the more I study, the more\n",
        "mysteries appear and multiply.\r",
        "Pokémon that evolve, and those that\n",
        "don’t...\r",
        "What makes them different from each\n",
        "other?\r",
        "Do those that are immature as living\n",
        "beings evolve to ones more mature?\r",
        "If so, what do we make of the\n",
        "legendary Pokémon that don’t evolve?\r",
        "Are we to assume that the legendary\n",
        "Pokémon are complete as creatures?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Mais plus je les étudie et plus le\n",
        "mystère s’épaissit.\r",
        "Certains Pokémon évoluent et\n",
        "d’autres pas...\r",
        "Qu’est-ce qui les rend si différents\n",
        "les uns des autres?\r",
        "Sont-ils des êtres imparfaits forcés\n",
        "d’évoluer pour survivre?\r",
        "Si c’est le cas, que penser des Pokémon\n",
        "légendaires qui n’évoluent pas?\r",
        "Doit-on en déduire que les Pokémon\n",
        "légendaires sont parfaits?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_HelpMeFindLakePokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "This is where you three come in.\r",
        "In the three lakes of Sinnoh, there\n",
        "are said to be mirage Pokémon.\r",
        "If we can obtain data on them,\n",
        "it may shed some light on how the\f",
        "process of Pokémon evolution works.\r",
        "I need help from each one of you\n",
        "on this grand undertaking.\r",
        "Help me find these Pokémon that are\n",
        "considered to be mirages.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est là que vous entrez en jeu.\r",
        "On dit que des Pokémon mirages\n",
        "vivent dans les trois lacs de Sinnoh.\r",
        "Si nous pouvions obtenir leurs données,\n",
        "nous pourrions peut-être faire la\f",
        "lumière sur l’évolution des Pokémon.\r",
        "C’est un travail titanesque, j’ai besoin\n",
        "de l’aide de chacun d’entre vous.\r",
        "Aidez-moi à trouver ces Pokémon que\n",
        "l’on considère comme des mirages.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_IDidntGetPokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What are you saying?\n",
        "I didn’t get a Pokédex!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Eh, mais minute!\n",
        "Je n’ai pas eu de Pokédex, moi!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_BoltedFromLab",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: ...And who was it that bolted\n",
        "from the lab before I had a chance\f",
        "to give you a Pokédex?\r",
        "But that’s water under the bridge!\r",
        "Seeing Pokémon with your own eyes is\n",
        "important for you in becoming a better\f",
        "Trainer, too.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: ... A qui la faute? C’est toi\n",
        "qui as quitté le labo sans me laisser\f",
        "le temps de te donner un Pokédex!\r",
        "Mais peu importe!\r",
        "Voir des Pokémon de tes propres yeux\n",
        "contribue aussi au développement de\f",
        "tes talents de Dresseur.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_DawnCountOnMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: You can count on me!\n",
        "It will help with my Pokédex, too.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you’ll go, too,\n",
        "won’t you?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Je n’y manquerai pas!\n",
        "Et puis, ça sera bon pour mon Pokédex.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, tu viens aussi,\n",
        "n’est-ce pas?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_LucasYouBet",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: You bet, Professor!\r",
        "This will add to the Pokédex\n",
        "database and help advance your\f",
        "research.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Pour sûr, professeur!\r",
        "Cela permettra d’étendre la base de\n",
        "données Pokémon pour faire avancer\f",
        "vos recherches.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_InvestigateLakesIndividually",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Hm! I would have made all of\n",
        "you go regardless... Anyway.\r",
        "Now, there are three lakes.\n",
        "Fortuitously, there are three of you.\r",
        "You should therefore split up and\n",
        "investigate the lakes individually.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: Hum! C’est une chance car j’ai\n",
        "besoin de tout le monde. Bref.\r",
        "Il y a trois lacs. Le hasard veut que\n",
        "vous soyez trois.\r",
        "Par conséquent, vous allez vous\n",
        "séparer pour visiter un lac chacun.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_DawnToLakeVerity",
      "en_US": "Rowan: Dawn, you go to Lake Verity.\r",
      "fr_FR": "Sorbier: Aurore, tu iras au Lac Vérité.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_DawnWillDo",
      "en_US": "Dawn: Will do!\r",
      "fr_FR": "Aurore: Bien reçu!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_LucasToLakeVerity",
      "en_US": "Rowan: Lucas, you go to Lake Verity.\r",
      "fr_FR": "Sorbier: Louka, tu iras au Lac Vérité.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_LucasYesSir",
      "en_US": "Lucas: Yes, sir!\r",
      "fr_FR": "Louka: Oui, monsieur!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_RivalToLakeAcuity",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I want you to\n",
        "investigate Lake Acuity.\r",
        "That would take you almost to\n",
        "Snowpoint City.\r",
        "The road there is harsh. I need\n",
        "a tough Trainer to go.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, je veux que tu\n",
        "enquêtes sur le Lac Savoir.\r",
        "C’est loin d’ici, quasiment\n",
        "à Frimapic.\r",
        "La route ne sera pas facile. Il faudra\n",
        "être un sacré Dresseur pour y arriver.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_YeahOfCourse",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Uh... Yeah, of course!\n",
        "Gramps, you know how to call it!\f",
        "You can tell I’m the hotness!\r",
        "And, you know what? I was going to\n",
        "catch those legendary Pokémon for you.\r",
        "You know, as thanks for giving us our\n",
        "Pokémon back on Route 201.\r",
        "...Even though I forgot completely\n",
        "about it until just now.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Euh... Pas de problème,\n",
        "pépé, tu me connais!\f",
        "Tu sais bien que je suis le meilleur!\r",
        "Et tu sais quoi? J’avais justement\n",
        "l’intention d’attraper ces Pokémon\f",
        "pour toi.\r",
        "Pour te remercier de nous avoir donné\n",
        "nos premiers Pokémon, sur la Route 201.\r",
        "Même si je viens juste de m’en\n",
        "souvenir...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_ThatLeavesLakeValor",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Very well.\n",
        "I’m counting on you.\r",
        "And that leaves {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} with\n",
        "Lake Valor.\r",
        "The lake is between Veilstone\n",
        "and Pastoria, if memory serves...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: Très bien.\n",
        "Je compte sur vous.\r",
        "Ainsi donc, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, il te reste\n",
        "le Lac Courage.\r",
        "Il se trouve entre Voilaroc et\n",
        "Verchamps, si ma mémoire est bonne...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_BigExplosion",
      "en_US": "{SIZE 200}DDDOOOMMM!!",
      "fr_FR": "{SIZE 200}BOUUUMMM!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_AreYouUnharmed",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: ...\n",
        "...Has it stopped?\r",
        "Are all of you unharmed?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: ...\n",
        "... C’est fini?\r",
        "Personne n’est blessé?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_WhatWasThatAbout",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What was that about?!\r",
        "No, wait, I mean, TV! The TV!\n",
        "News! Anything!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Mais qu’est-ce qui s’est\n",
        "passé?!\r",
        "La télé! Allumez la télé! Les infos!\n",
        "Faites quelque chose! N’importe quoi!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_NewsExplosion",
      "en_US": [
        "Announcer: What you’ve just witnessed\n",
        "is actual footage from the scene.\r",
        "It was taken by a cameraman who\n",
        "happened to be there.\r",
        "Newscaster: It’s certainly impressive.\r",
        "Who knows what the explosion could\n",
        "expose at the lake?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Présentateur: La vidéo que vous venez\n",
        "de voir a été enregistrée par un témoin\f",
        "sur place.\r",
        "Journaliste: Impressionnant!\r",
        "Qui sait ce qui pourrait être révélé\n",
        "après cette explosion au lac?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_TheySaidExplosion",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Gramps!\n",
        "They said it was an explosion?!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Pépé!\r",
        "Ils ont bien dit que c’était\n",
        "une explosion?!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_LetsGetOutside",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Hmm...\n",
        "But why at Lake Valor...?\r",
        "Let’s get outside.\n",
        "I’m concerned about the town.\r",
        "You kids, be careful going down the\n",
        "stairs.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: Hum...\n",
        "Mais pourquoi au Lac Courage...?\r",
        "Sortons.\n",
        "Je m’inquiète pour la ville.\r",
        "Prudence en descendant les escaliers,\n",
        "les enfants.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_LeaveNowToo",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\n",
        "You should leave now, too.\r",
        "...There may be aftershocks, however.\n",
        "Be alert always.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\n",
        "Tu devrais partir maintenant.\r",
        "Cependant, il pourrait y avoir des\n",
        "répliques...\r",
        "Reste sur tes gardes.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_BooksContainMemories",
      "en_US": [
        "Every book contains someone’s\n",
        "memories of various places and times.\r",
        "Libraries aren’t just buildings where\n",
        "books are kept, you know.\r",
        "They’re where different places\n",
        "and times are gathered together."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Chaque livre contient la mémoire\n",
        "d’un individu, les lieux qu’il a connus.\r",
        "Les bibliothèques ne sont pas seulement\n",
        "des endroits où l’on garde des livres.\r",
        "Elles sont le lieu où convergent\n",
        "plusieurs époques et réalités."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_WasThatAnEarthquake",
      "en_US": [
        "W-was that an earthquake?\n",
        "I didn’t imagine it?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C... c’était un tremblement de terre?\n",
        "Ou seulement mon imagination?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_BookAlwaysCheckedOut",
      "en_US": [
        "Someone’s always checked out the\n",
        "book I want to read..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Les livres que je cherche sont toujours\n",
        "empruntés par quelqu’un d’autre..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_ImFeelingWobbly",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m feeling wobbly...\r",
        "Even though the tremor has ended,\n",
        "my knees still feel like jelly..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je me sens patraque...\r",
        "Même après la secousse, j’ai toujours\n",
        "les genoux en compote..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_AskReadSinnohMyth",
      "en_US": [
        "This book is titled “Sinnoh\n",
        "Myth.” Want to read it?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ce livre s’intitule “Mythes de Sinnoh”.\n",
        "Voulez-vous le lire?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_PutSinnohMythBack",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} put the book back.",
      "fr_FR": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} remet le livre à sa place."
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_SinnohMyth",
      "en_US": [
        "“Sinnoh Myth”\r",
        "Betray not your anger, lest ??? will\n",
        "come.\r",
        "Weep not with sorrow, or ??? will\n",
        "draw near.\r",
        "When joy and enjoyment come natural\n",
        "as the very air, that is happiness.\r",
        "Let such be blessed by the hand\n",
        "of Master ???.\r",
        "Those words were spoken often\n",
        "as customary."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "“Mythes de Sinnoh”\r",
        "Ne trahissez point votre haine, pour ne\n",
        "pas précipiter la venue de ???.\r",
        "Chassez au loin vos sanglots, pour \n",
        "éviter que ??? ne s’approche.\r",
        "Lorsque la joie et la célébration seront\n",
        "pour vous des sentiments naturels,\f",
        "vous aurez atteint la béatitude.\r",
        "Ceux-là seront bénis par le Maître ???.\r",
        "Autrefois, on avait coutume de\n",
        "prononcer cette formule."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_AskReadSinnohRegionsMythology",
      "en_US": [
        "This book is titled “Sinnoh Region’s\n",
        "Mythology.” Want to read it?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ce livre s’intitule “Mythologie de la\n",
        "région de Sinnoh”. Voulez-vous le lire?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_PutSinnohRegionsMythologyBack",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} put the book back.",
      "fr_FR": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} remet le livre à sa place."
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_SinnohRegionsMythology",
      "en_US": [
        "“Sinnoh Region’s Mythology”\r",
        "Long ago, when Sinnoh had just been\n",
        "made, Pokémon and humans led\f",
        "separate lives.\r",
        "That is not to say they did not help\n",
        "each other. No, indeed they did.\r",
        "They supplied each other with goods,\n",
        "and supported each other.\r",
        "A Pokémon proposed to the others\n",
        "to always be ready to help humans.\r",
        "It asked that Pokémon be ready to\n",
        "appear before humans always.\r",
        "Thus, to this day, Pokémon appear\n",
        "to us if we venture into tall grass."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "“Mythologie de la région de Sinnoh”\r",
        "Il y a fort longtemps, peu après la \n",
        "création de Sinnoh, les gens et les\f",
        "Pokémon vivaient séparément.\r",
        "Ce qui ne veut pas dire qu’il n’y avait\n",
        "aucune entraide, loin de là.\r",
        "Ils échangeaient de la nourriture et\n",
        "se soutenaient mutuellement.\r",
        "Un Pokémon proposa aux siens d’être\n",
        "toujours prêts à aider les humains.\r",
        "Il leur demanda d’aller au devant des\n",
        "humains pour leur proposer leur aide.\r",
        "Depuis, les Pokémon se montrent à ceux\n",
        "qui s’aventurent dans les hautes\f",
        "herbes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_AskReadSinnohsMyth",
      "en_US": [
        "This book is titled “Sinnoh’s\n",
        "Myth.” Want to read it?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ce livre s’intitule “Le Mythe de\n",
        "Sinnoh”. Voulez-vous le lire?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_PutSinnohsMythBack",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} put the book back.",
      "fr_FR": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} remet le livre à sa place."
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_SinnohsMyth",
      "en_US": [
        "“Sinnoh’s Myth”\r",
        "Three Pokémon there were.\r",
        "Into the lakes they dove.\n",
        "Deep, deep, drawing no breath.\r",
        "Deeper, deeper they dove.\n",
        "Into suffocating depths they dove.\r",
        "Deeper, then deepest they alight.\n",
        "From the lake floor they rise.\r",
        "Bearing with them the power to make\n",
        "vast lands, they rise again."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "“Le Mythe de Sinnoh”\r",
        "Ils étaient trois Pokémon.\r",
        "Au fond des lacs, ils plongèrent,\n",
        "au plus profond, sans reprendre d’air.\r",
        "Au plus profond, ils s’enfoncèrent\n",
        "jusqu’aux abîmes suffocants.\r",
        "Et continuèrent jusqu’à toucher le fond\n",
        "avant d’entamer leur ascension,\r",
        "pour refaire surface, doués du pouvoir\n",
        "de révéler les terres immergées."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_AskReadVeilstonesMyth",
      "en_US": [
        "This book is titled “Veilstone’s\n",
        "Myth.” Want to read it?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le livre s’intitule “Le Mythe de\n",
        "Voilaroc”. Voulez-vous le lire?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_PutVeilstonesMythBack",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} put the book back.",
      "fr_FR": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} remet le livre à sa place."
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_VeilstonesMyth1",
      "en_US": [
        "“Veilstone’s Myth”\r",
        "A young man, callow and foolish in\n",
        "innocence, came to own a sword.\r",
        "With it, he smote Pokémon, which gave\n",
        "sustenance, with carefree abandon.\r",
        "Those not taken as food, he\n",
        "discarded, with no afterthought.\r",
        "The following year, no Pokémon\n",
        "appeared. Larders grew bare.\r",
        "...Would you like to keep reading?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "“Le Mythe de Voilaroc”\r",
        "Un jeune homme, novice autant \n",
        "qu’innocent, reçut la garde d’une épée.\r",
        "Ainsi armé, il pourfendit les Pokémon\n",
        "pour s’en repaître jusqu’à la lie.\r",
        "Il abandonna sans une pensée les corps\n",
        "de ceux qu’il ne voulait pas manger.\r",
        "L’année suivante, aucun Pokémon ne se\n",
        "montra. Les réserves s’épuisaient.\r",
        "... Voulez-vous continuer à lire?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary3F_Text_VeilstonesMyth2",
      "en_US": [
        "The young man, seeking the missing\n",
        "Pokémon, journeyed afar.\r",
        "Long did he search. And far and wide,\n",
        "too, until one he did find.\r",
        "Asked he, “Why do you hide?”\n",
